==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Fireproof Lizard}}
Fireproof Lizards can be found in the [[Scorching Climate]]s of [[Hyrule]], particularly [[Death Mountain]] and the nearby [[Eldin Canyon]]. They can be combined with [[Monster Part]]s in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make a [[Fireproof Elixir]], which will provide [[Link]] with temporary [[Flame Guard]] when consumed.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> However, if they are [[Cooking|Cooked]] with other ingredients, the result will be [[Dubious Food]]. The [[Kochi Dye Shop]] also accepts Fireproof Lizards as an ingredient for [[Gray Dye]].

If [[Link]] speaks to [[Kima]] at the [[Southern Mine]], he explains that he is returning from [[Goron City]] and forgot to buy a souvenir.<ref name="BotW Kima"/> He says that he wants some Fireproof Lizards and offers Link [[Fireproof Armor]] if he can catch 10.<ref name="BotW Kima 2"/> This begins the "[[Fireproof Lizard Roundup]]" [[Side Quest]]. When Link brings the Fireproof Lizards, Kima will reward him with [[Flamebreaker Armor]].<ref name="BotW Kima 3"/><ref name="BotW Kima 4"/> Afterwards, Link can deliver three Fireproof Lizards to Kima for 20 [[Rupee]]s.<ref name="BotW Kima 5"/>

